x = -2&radic;3x/2x</p><p>=&gt; x/2 + 2/x = -&radic;3</p><p>=&gt; (x/2 + 2/x)<sup>3</sup> = (-&radic;3)<sup>3</sup></p><p>=&gt; x<sup>3</sup>/8 + 8/x<sup>3</sup> + 3 * (-&radic;3) = -3&radic;3</p><p>=&gt; x<sup>3</sup>/8 + 8/x<sup>3</sup> = 0</p><p>=&gt; x<sup>6</sup> + 64 = 0</p><p>=&gt; x<sup>6</sup> = -64 ----(i)</p><p>(x<sup>7</sup> + x<sup>6</sup> + 64x + 80)</p><p>= x<sup>6</sup>(x + 1) + 64x + 80</p><p>= -64(x + 1) + 64x + 80</p><p>= -64x -64 + 64x + 80</p><p>= 16</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>If x  -  4&radic;x  -  1 = 0, then x<sup>2</sup> + 1/x<sup>2</sup> is equal to  -  </p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; x - 4&radic;x - 1 = 0, &#2340;&#2379; x<sup>2</sup> + 1/x<sup>2</sup> &#2348;&#2352;&#2366;&#2348;&#2352; &#2361;&#2376; - </p>", "options_en": ["256", "322", "258", "326"], "options_hi": ["256", "322", "258", "326"], "answer": 1, "solution_en": "<p>x  -  4&radic;x  -  1 = 0</p><p>&radic;x  -  1/&radic;x = 4</p><p>Squaring both sides - </p><p>(&radic;x  -  1/&radic;x)<sup>2</sup> = 16</p><p>x + 1/x = 18</p><p>Squaring both sides - </p><p>(x + 1/x)<sup>2</sup> = 324</p><p>x<sup>2</sup> + 1/x<sup>2</sup> = 322</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>x  -  4&radic;x  -  1 = 0</p><p>&radic;x  -  1/&radic;x = 4</p><p>Squaring both sides - </p><p>(&radic;x  -  1/&radic;x)<sup>2</sup> = 16</p><p>x + 1/x = 18</p><p>Squaring both sides - </p><p>(x + 1/x)<sup>2</sup> = 324</p><p>x<sup>2</sup> + 1/x<sup>2</sup> = 322</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>If 1/(x + 4)  -  x = 7, then what is the value of 1/(x + 4)<sup>2</sup> + (x + 4)<sup>2</sup>?</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; 1/(x + 4) - x = 7, &#2340;&#2379; 1/(x + 4)<sup>2</sup> + (x + 4)<sup>2</sup> &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;?</p>", "options_en": ["11", "15", "9", "7"], "options_hi": ["11", "15", "9", "7"], "answer": 0, "solution_en": "<p>1/(x + 4)  -  x = 7</p><p>1/(x + 4)  -  (x + 4) = 3</p><p>Squaring both sides  -  </p><p>1/(x +